<title>POLAND: Izolacja jumps 38 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Izolacja jumps 38 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insulation materials maker Izolacja SA started trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market on Monday at 165.5 zlotys, 37.9 percent above its issue price.</p>
<p>The company's 100,130-share December initial public offering, priced at 120 zlotys per share, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
